  unitName: Quake Fist Nemia
  unitId: 30144
  unitNumber: 437
  description: A boxer who studied martial arts at the Toltya Dojo. She entered tournament
    after tournament looking for her parents, but after so many victories she became
    somewhat prideful. In addition to the invasion of the gods, she soon saw herself
    in a crisis. She was then saved by the boy who was once her pupil. Though she
    now continued her training out of the shame in how prideful she had become, it
    has also been said that she was strict on herself in part because she'd come
    to see her former pupil as a grown man.
  summonDesc: I'm so happy to have<br>this chance to grow.<br>What are you looking
    at?
  fusionDesc: Alright, let's go!<br>I'll smash everything with<br>my god-like fists!
  evoDesc: I'm stronger, don't you think?<br>But I'm still looking forward.<br>I
    can't lose another fight!
